    "open_questions": [
      "Which songs on Let's Dance are his: Rodgers left them uncredited on purpose, and named Modern Love as Hakim's (Sound On Sound). The record names him on it as a co-drummer only.",
      "Dance, Dance, Dance, He's the Greatest Dancer, I'm Coming Out, Some Like It Hot and Material Girl have no human drum tab on Songsterr (machine tabs only), so they are not played.",
      "We Are Family's tab is from 2010 and its track is not named for him; its kick on 1 and 3 is unchecked against the record.",
      "Grohl's 'big disco flam' is the style's only flam: where Thompson played it is not transcribed.",
      "His Chic-era kits are not sourced beyond one tab's note (Yamaha, Zildjian Ks, a Ludwig Supraphonic snare); the kit on Musikladen cannot be read."
    ]
  },
